WEBVTT

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:06.270
9 tails appeared suddenly. The movements of their tails crushed mountains, causing

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:12.960
tides that destroyed the coast. The ninjas gathered to defend their altars.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:20.220
Wait for the Hokage to arrive! He is approaching my village, it's a village!

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:30.000
A shinobi faced the 9-tailed fox in a deadly fight. He sacrificed his life to

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.960
capture the beast and seal his spirit inside a human body

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:42.290
this ninja was known as the fourth Hokage

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:27.650
MY HANDS ON YOU!

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:30.000
YOU PASSED THE LIMITS THIS TIME!

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:41.500
Hahaha! You don't have the guts to do what I do, do you?

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:46.650
Losers! Mediocre! You'll never catch me! Hahaha!

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:49.650
Great Hokage! It's an emergency!

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:54.510
I hope it's not another nonsense. And don't tell me it's Naruto again.

00:01:54.510 --> 00:02:00.000
It's Naruto again. He closed his stone faces and pecked everything that was wrong.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:01.370
"Naruto, wait!"

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:02.340
"It was a joke."

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:05.660
"That's right, Naruto."

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:06.660
"Where did you come from, Iroka-sensei?

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:07.660
What are you doing here?"

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:08.660
"No, what are you doing here?"

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:09.600
"What are you doing here?"

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:10.970
"What are you doing here?"

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:11.970
"No, what are you doing here?"

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:12.970
"No, what are you doing here?"

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:18.430
"No, what are you doing here?"

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:19.670
"No, what are you doing here?"

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:20.670
"No, what are you doing here?"

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:21.560
"No, what are you doing here?"

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:22.560
"No, what are you doing here?"

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:25.510
"No, what are you doing here?"

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:26.510
"No, what are you doing here?"

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:27.510
"No, what are you doing here?"

00:02:27.510 --> 00:02:28.520
"No, what are you doing here?"

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:29.520
"No, what are you doing here?"

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:30.000
What are you doing?

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.700
Being here, you should be in class.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:34.960
I'm already tired, Naruto.

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:39.280
You didn't pass the tests yesterday, nor the previous ones.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:41.170
Tomorrow you'll have another chance.

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:42.990
And you're throwing this one through the window.

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:43.760
Hmph!

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:46.210
Ah, really?

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:50.430
Because of you, Naruto, everyone will have to go through the transformation jutsu!

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:54.850
Very well, Sakura. This is the time.

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:56.280
TRANSFORMATION!

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:59.540
Did you transform into me?

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:08.620
Did you see that?

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:09.560
Next.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:10.930
Sasuke Uchiha.

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:22.160
Next.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:23.880
Naruto Uzumaki.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:26.190
This is a great waste of time, Naruto.

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:28.390
We always pay for your mistakes.

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:30.000
Hah! Take this!

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:05.350
Damn it, I'm sick of it.

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:09.540
You're not going home until you've cleaned the last drop of ink.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:14.040
Hey, there's no one waiting for me at home, I'm in a hurry.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:22.820
Naruto.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.840
What happened now, sensei?

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:26.820
Well, I was thinking...

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:30.000
What if after you clean all this, we...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.000
What do you think about eating a ramen?

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:39.530
You spoke my language! I'm going to clear everything up quickly!

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:43.410
Naruto Uzumaki is coming!

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:55.340
Naruto.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:59.960
Why did you do that to Hokage's faces?

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:03.110
You know very well who they were, don't you?

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:06.400
Of course I know!

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:17.890
Everyone knows! They were the greatest shinobi of their time, the best of all, invincible ninja champions!

00:05:17.890 --> 00:05:26.370
Fourth Hokage was the one who saved the village of the nine-tailed fox, he was the most incredible!

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:27.830
So why?

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:30.000
Because I will be bigger than everyone else!

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:35.560
Me! Naruto! Aki! A beautiful ninja!

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:38.770
People will stop despising me and look at me!

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:41.360
I'm right!

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:45.420
And there's one thing, I'd like to ask a favor, Sensei.

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:47.890
Do you want another bowl?

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:51.650
No, I want to try your bandana, please!

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:55.330
Ah, what's that? Don't even think about it.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.500
You'll only be able to wear a bandana like this

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:00.000
after you graduate from the academy and become

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.140
NARU NINJA, you need to pass the test tomorrow.

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:05.320
This is not JUSCO!

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:07.320
Is that why you took off your glasses?

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:10.210
Ah, I want another bowl!

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:13.700
Let's start the final test.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:17.860
When your name is called, go to the test room.

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:20.860
The final test will be about the Jutsu of Cloning.

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:24.260
This is my worst technique!

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:27.180
Oh my God, I'll never pass!

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:28.000
ZUN!

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:35.250
Go! Concentration, Naruto! You can do it!

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:36.530
I'm sure!

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:41.400
Cloning Jutsu!

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:51.510
You failed!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:07:00.000
Iruka-sensei, he failed, but he has persistence, excellent skills and got a replica.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:03.810
It's his third attempt, and you know how much he wants to become a ninja.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:06.180
I think we could give him a chance to prove it.

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:11.940
Mizuki-sensei, the other students managed to do at least three clonings.

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:15.430
But Naruto only did one.

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:17.120
And look at him.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.550
Regrettable.

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:22.520
I can't approve it.

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:26.050
It was amazing, I'm a real ninja!

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:40.290
There, can you see him?

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:41.460
Is it him?

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:43.920
I heard that he was the only one reprimanded.

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:46.510
Well done to him.

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:49.860
Imagine if he had become a ninja.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.340
He is the boy who...

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:54.290
Shhh, it is forbidden to talk about it.

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:59.510
Huh?

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:06.900
Listen, Iruka, we need to talk.

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:16.670
Iruka-sensei is tough, but it's nothing personal.

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:19.560
So why? Because it's me!

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:24.040
He just wants you to be strong, from the bottom of his heart.

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:27.390
But that will never happen if he makes things easier for you.

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:30.000
He's like you, you know? No peace.

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.300
No family?

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:32.830
But...

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:36.320
This time I wanted to form myself.

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:39.900
So I think I'll have to tell you.

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:44.640
It's a secret, but I'll tell you.

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:47.700
A secret?

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:51.340
Iruka.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:55.580
What is it, Great Hokage?

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:57.860
I know how it feels.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:09:00.000
You grew up like a Naruto.

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:03.780
...without knowing the love of a mother and a father...

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:06.080
...nor the warmth of a family.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:10.320
- We're going to the football stadium! - We're going to the stadium!

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:14.500
- We're going to the stadium! - We're going to the stadium!

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:24.200
- Miruka-sensei, wake up! - What? What happened?

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:27.040
The great Hokage wants to see you immediately.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:28.870
It's about Naruto.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:34.310
- He stole the sacred scroll. - Stole the seal scroll? No!

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:42.480
Let me see... The first one is the Jutsu Multiclones of the Shadows.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:46.620
This one again is not my worst jutsu!

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:50.570
Great Hokage, this is not a joke, it is a very serious crime!

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:54.580
This scroll contains secrets that were sealed by the first Hokage.

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:56.580
Secrets that only speak about our village!

00:09:56.580 --> 00:10:00.000
If you fall in the wrong hands, you can destroy our lives!

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:05.310
Well, bring Naruto immediately.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:06.530
Yes, sir!

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:27.130
Where did he go?

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:30.000
Now, to make everyone happy, what Naruto did, I've already told you.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:34.800
I can't end with him! They will be happy with your absence and of course the scroll will be all mine!

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:45.720
Now it's over!

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:54.770
You found me! Not bad!

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:58.120
You are fast sensei! I only had time to learn a technique!

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:00.000
He was training?

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:03.040
You can see how much effort he made.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:08.880
Look, Iruka-sensei, I'm going to show you an incredible Jutsu and you're going to let me train and everything's going to be cool.

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:12.740
That's how it works. Whoever learns a Jutsu from the scroll passes, right?

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:14.850
Huh? Where did you get that from?

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:22.100
Mizuki-sensei told me. I'm right. He told me where to find the scroll and about this place and...

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:25.320
Mizuki...

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:30.000
Watch out!

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:33.430
So you found our chosen ones.

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:38.910
So that was it, huh? I should know.

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:42.640
Naruto! Give me the scroll now!

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:48.510
Wait a minute! What's going on here?

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:51.870
Naruto! Don't let Mizuki get the scroll!

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:55.460
It contains forbidden jutsus that can put the village in great danger!

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:59.510
Mizuki used you to get the scroll for him, for your own power!

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:06.930
You know, Naruto, Iruka only wants to scare you because he doesn't want you to have a parchment.

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:07.930
Huh?

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:11.770
Stop lying, Mizuki!

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:13.590
Don't let him fool you, Naruto!

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:16.590
I'll tell you who's lying here.

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:18.590
Enough, Mizuki!

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:21.590
They've lied to you all your life, Naruto.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.700
Since the law 12 years ago.

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:25.780
What's that?

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:27.920
Everyone knows, except you.

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:30.000
Iruka and everyone wants to hide it.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.700
and I would do anything to shut my mouth.

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:34.370
What do you mean?

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:36.770
What everyone knows is bullshit!

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:38.730
Shut your mouth! It's forbidden!

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:43.230
No one can tell you that the nine-tailed fox spirit is inside you.

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:48.990
The fox spirit that killed Iruka's parents and destroyed our village

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.690
is sealed inside your body.

00:12:50.690 --> 00:12:52.390
You are the nine-tailed fox.

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:53.890
Stop it!

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:58.040
Everyone kept this secret and hid it from you all their lives.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.000
Don't you find it strange how they treat you?

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:04.780
as if it were trash, as if they hated you just because you were alive.

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:09.380
No!

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:11.350
Naruto!

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:14.350
That's why you will never be accepted in this village.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:18.480
Even your beloved sensei hates you, even your soul.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:23.330
Iruka, Naruto never had a mother or a father who cared about him.

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:25.790
He was marginalized and doesn't know why.

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:30.000
Many people don't even look at him, as he would feel everywhere

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:32.690
If it were, people would give their backs to you.

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:36.680
That's why he gets into trouble, so that people notice him.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:40.850
He may not show it, but he's always thinking about the family he doesn't have.

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:43.250
He's hurt inside.

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:46.460
Time to die, Naruto!

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:50.850
Naruto, get down!

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:08.830
Why are we the same?

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:13.540
When I lost my parents, no one cared about me.

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.650
They didn't have time for me.

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:17.890
They forgot that I existed.

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:19.780
My grades dropped.

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:21.670
I became the clown of the class.

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:26.200
I just wanted them to see me and know my name.

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:30.000
But school wasn't enough to call attention.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:35.810
their attention, so I did a lot of crazy things and I had to pay for them.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:44.900
That was hard. I know what you feel, Naruto. You feel loneliness and it hurts inside.

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:54.120
I could have done more for you. I abandoned you. Sorry, no one should suffer like that.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:58.870
No one should be alone like that.

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:02.090
Don't make me laugh!

00:15:02.090 --> 00:15:03.940
Iruka has always hated you!

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:09.540
He's an orphan because the nine-tailed fox that killed his parents is inside your body now!

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:13.000
He would say anything to take the scroll from you!

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:16.870
Naruto!

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.870
NARUTO!

00:15:20.910 --> 00:15:25.000
You know, when he decides something, nobody makes him change his mind.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:28.130
He will use the scroll to get revenge on the village.

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:32.210
Didn't you see the look in his eyes?

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:34.330
Those are the eyes of the beast!

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:41.350
It's not like that!

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:46.680
Don't make a joke!

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.960
After I finish Naruto and get the scroll.

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:50.940
I'll be back here to take care of you!

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:54.500
I won't let you!

00:15:57.240 --> 00:16:00.000
That's it!

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.990
It will end badly.

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:08.240
Mizuki spoke too much and made Naruto feel worse than he ever felt.

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:15.320
This may have dethroned the power that is within him if Naruto continues using the curse.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:22.590
The seal that pierces the spirit of the fox inside him can break and the beast leave.

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:27.730
And if that happens, I fear for all of us.

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:34.470
Everything Mizuki said is a lie!

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:39.000
Bring the parchment, quick! He's coming after you to get it!

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:41.080
Go!

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:04.060
How did you find out, Naruto?

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:06.570
How did you find out?

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:10.220
That it was me and not Iruka!

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:16.270
Because I am Iruka.

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:19.040
You are an idiot.

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:21.630
Why are you protecting that abomination?

00:17:21.630 --> 00:17:24.650
Because of him, your family died.

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:26.920
It doesn't matter what you tell me.

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:28.920
You're not going to put your hands on the parchment.

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:30.000
Oh yeah? And who are you?

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.400
Who will stop me?

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:34.860
Don't you realize that Naruto is just like me?

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.290
What do you mean?

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:40.250
He doesn't want the scroll for his own power and his own revenge.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:42.230
That's how the beasts are.

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:46.630
He will put all his fury on the scroll and will destroy everything.

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:48.180
You're right.

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:52.960
Ah, so that's it.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:55.420
Iruka-sensei never believed in me.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:59.350
He thinks I'm a beast, a kind of monster.

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:01.800
That's how beasts are.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:06.200
But Naruto isn't like that.

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:07.920
He's nothing like that.

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:09.700
Naruto is special.

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:12.040
He works hard, puts his heart into things.

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:15.330
Of course, he makes mistakes and gets angry sometimes.

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:18.180
But his suffering makes him stronger.

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:20.880
And that differentiates him from a beast.

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:24.210
He has nothing to do with the nine-tailed fox.

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.870
He is Naruto Uzumaki.

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:30.000
Naruto of the Leaf Village.

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:37.400
You're trying to say I'm lying, aren't you?

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:41.000
Iruka, I was going to let you go last, but I changed my mind.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:42.300
You're already gone!

00:18:44.130 --> 00:18:45.590
So that's it.

00:18:45.590 --> 00:18:54.390
Naruto!

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:59.480
Son of a bitch!

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:03.740
NEVER PUT THIS DIRTY HAND ON MY SENSEI!

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:05.350
OR I'LL KILL YOU!

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:06.980
Those are nice words...

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:10.510
But I can end you with a simple move!

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:12.670
You can come, idiot!

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:15.430
I'll return multiplied by a thousand!

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:16.860
Then let's go!

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:19.800
Show me what you know how to do, nine-tailed fox!

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:24.130
Jutsu Multiclones of Shadow!

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:36.800
They are not just illusions, they are clones of truth!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:39.800
He has improved in a super advanced Jutsu!

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:45.000
I'm here! I can't believe it! What is this? I can't believe it!

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:55.790
If you don't come, I'll go to the ground and get you!

00:20:02.140 --> 00:20:12.080
I think I got a little excited. Are you okay, Iruka-sensei?

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:18.590
I am. He's amazing. He wants to surpass all Hokage.

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:21.510
I'm starting to believe he can do it.

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:29.420
Naruto, come here. I want to give you something.

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:30.000
What?

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:32.090
No one found Naruto!

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:34.090
No signal.

00:20:34.090 --> 00:20:37.110
That's not good. We need to find him anyway.

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:39.930
You don't need to worry anymore.

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:41.930
Huh? Great Hokage!

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:45.920
The scroll is safe. Naruto will be back soon.

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:49.870
Yes, yes. There's still a long way to go.

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:53.000
All right. You can open your eyes now.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.480
I'm scared.

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:08.320
Congratulations! You passed!

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:16.320
And to celebrate, I have a surprise!

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:18.410
Let's eat lamen tonight!

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:29.170
Hahahaha!

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:43.090
This is just the beginning, the path will be more difficult now that I am a ninja, but if I said that to you now, I think I would ruin the moment, so I will say later, commander.

00:22:18.910 --> 00:22:22.910
He is a boy with superpowers. Poor school valentine.

00:22:22.910 --> 00:22:27.810
Don't miss Ben 10, from Monday to Friday at 2pm on Cartoon Network.

00:22:27.810 --> 00:22:30.000
So get ready!

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:34.570
Because to become a Hokage, you'll have to beat me first!

00:22:34.570 --> 00:22:38.200
In the next episode, my name is Konohamaru!
